<title>USA: TABLE - GM July US domestic car sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GM July US domestic car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   232,324	   226,971	     +2.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 179,931	   161,301	    +11.5</p>
<p> Import Car		 2,142		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck		 171		 219	    -21.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jul 31, 1997 Jan 1-Jul 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	 1,558,524	 1,716,330	     -8.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,188,584	 1,170,486	     +2.1</p>
<p> Import Car		13,534		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,739	     1,797	     -2.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 179 for year to date vs 180 in year ago.</p>
</text>
